B.aoH=s(["In the iPhone and iPad PWA, a left-edge right swipe is now handled by worCat and moves to the previous page instead of exposing the iOS back view.","A right-edge left swipe still moves to the next page, while dashboard and work tracking remain the bounded endpoints."],t.s)
