B.ac3=s(["Ledger entries, schedules, and work tasks can repeat daily, every 2 to 10 days, or on a selected monthly date.","Recurring items support an optional end date or no end date and can be paused or resumed from the account menu.","The next month is prepared from the 15th, while deleted individual occurrences stay excluded."],t.s)
